  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:55:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:55:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. I have a, um, a thing to report. I wrote it down, so I read it. Okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:55:10-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, take your time. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:55:12-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The sidewalk is broken. It has heaved up, like a hill. I tripped on it on Sunday. The location is 398 Gidley Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:55:18-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "398 Gidley Street. Okay. Are you all right? Did you get hurt?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:55:22-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am okay, thank you. Only my knee, a little. Also, there is a hole next to it. After the storm that ended Saturday, it is full of water. You cannot see it. It is hard to see."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:55:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So a heaved sidewalk and a hole beside it, filled with water, at 398 Gidley. I'll put that in as a hazard so a crew looks at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:55:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, that is right. Could I have a reference number, please?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:55:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. Hold on one second while it generates. [pause] Okay, it's coming up. Do you have a pen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:55:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I have the pen. Oh, it is almost noon already. On the phone the time goes so fast."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:55:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It really does. Okay, I'll read it slowly, and I'll repeat it back to you."
    }
  ],
